.TH SENEMOS-FASTFETCH 1 "September 2026" "senemos-fastfetch-config 1.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
senemos-fastfetch \- display system information using the SENEMOS locale configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B senemos-fastfetch
.RI [ fastfetch-options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B senemos-fastfetch
selects a translated Fastfetch configuration from the current message locale
and executes Fastfetch with all supplied command-line options.
.PP
Interactive system shells define fastfetch as a function that invokes this
launcher. Direct execution of /usr/bin/fastfetch remains available.
.PP
Regional locale names map to their base language. Unsupported locales and the
C and POSIX locales fall back to English.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B FASTFETCH_LOCALE
Overrides locale selection. For example, tr_TR selects Turkish and zh_CN
selects Chinese.
.TP
.B LC_ALL, LC_MESSAGES, LANGUAGE, LANG
Standard locale variables, consulted in this order when FASTFETCH_LOCALE is
not set.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/senemos-fastfetch-config/i18n/
Translated Fastfetch configuration files.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fastfetch (1)
